{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Knot.CatalanValueBounds","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Knot.CatalanValueBounds","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.PSeries","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecificLimits.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Knot.ClausenValueBounds"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.abs_Vol_Borromean_sub_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.abs_Vol_Borromean_sub_lt","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L170-L183","doc":"`|Vol(𝓑₃) − 7.3277247534| < 2/5` — the Borromean-volume carrier\n`Vol_Borromean = 8·Cl₂(π/2)` meets the `8G` binding-scale decimal.\n(bean qou-8gv9) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.Cl_2_pi_div_two_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.Cl_2_pi_div_two_pos","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L159-L168","doc":"`Cl₂(π/2) > 0` — the Catalan constant is positive, straight from the\ncertified interval (`RAT − 1/24 > 0`). The boundary-exclusion input the\nBorromean B4 extremum analysis needs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.abs_Catalan_sub_decimal_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.abs_Catalan_sub_decimal_lt","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L150-L157","doc":"`|G − 0.9159655942| < 1/20` — the Catalan carrier meets its standard\ndecimal. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.abs_Catalan_sub_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.abs_Catalan_sub_le","kind":"theorem","line":141,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L141-L148","doc":"**Certified bound on the Catalan constant.** The exact rational 24-term\npartial sum approximates `G = Cl₂(π/2)` within `1/24`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.catS24_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.catS24_eq","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L82-L139","doc":"The 24-term partial sum, exactly: a pure rational (the alternating odd\ninverse squares `1 − 1/9 + 1/25 − … − 1/529`), by the period-4 sine\npattern `sin(kπ/2) ∈ {1, 0, −1, 0}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.cat_tail_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.cat_tail_le","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L53-L80","doc":"Crude certified tail bound past 24 terms, via the `ClausenValueBounds`\ntelescoping series. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.summable_catTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.summable_catTerm","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L49-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.norm_catTerm_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.norm_catTerm_le","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L42-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.catalan_eq_tsum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.catalan_eq_tsum","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L39-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Knot.catTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Knot.catTerm","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Knot/CatalanValueBounds.lean#L35-L37","doc":"The `k`-th term of the `Cl₂(π/2)` (Catalan) Fourier series. ","signatureChunk":0}]}